@startuml
title ATM Withdrawal Scenario

[*] --> SelectAmount

state "Select Amount" as SelectAmount
state "Verify Transaction" as VerifyTransaction
state "Re-enter Amount" as ReenterAmount

SelectAmount : entry / Display list of withdrawal options
SelectAmount : do / User selects an amount from the list or enters a custom value
SelectAmount : exit / [custom] or [list]

[*] --> SelectAmount : [initial state]

SelectAmount --> VerifyTransaction : [amount selected]
VerifyTransaction : entry / Validate transaction
VerifyTransaction : do / Transaction verification
VerifyTransaction : exit / [success] or [failure]

VerifyTransaction --> ReenterAmount : [transaction failed]
ReenterAmount : entry / Display error message and prompt user to re-enter amount
ReenterAmount : do / User re-enters an amount
ReenterAmount : exit / [amount entered]

ReenterAmount --> VerifyTransaction : [new amount entered]

VerifyTransaction --> [*] : [transaction successful]

@enduml
